## PowerShell Hunting Query

In addition to DET-003, a broader PowerShell hunting search was developed.

```spl
index=* "powershell"
("-EncodedCommand" OR "-NoProfile" OR "-NonInteractive" OR "Hidden")
```

This search is intentionally broader than DET-003.

It can identify PowerShell executions containing arguments such as:

```text
-EncodedCommand
-NoProfile
-NonInteractive
-WindowStyle Hidden
```

Because these arguments can also occur during legitimate administration, this query was classified as a hunting query rather than a high-confidence alert.

Saved as:

```text
HUNT - Suspicious PowerShell Arguments
```

